WEBVTT

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:05.560
Watu wengi wanapigwa na
kutupwa jela.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.880
Wengine wanauliwa 
kama Jonathan Daniels.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:15.816
Na bado, sisi bado, kama taifa,

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.800
tumezama chini

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.920
kwenye udongo wa ubaguzi wa rangi.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.136
Na kila mahali ninapoenda kuzunguka nchi,